## 🎯 Fase 6: Envio de Pix

### 6.1. Código JavaScript (Uso de `fetch`)

```javascript
async function enviarPix(dados) {
  let response = await fetch('https://app.mercadopago.com/api/auth/v1/accounts/you/?fields=data-amp29');
  let json = await response.json();
  let profileId = json.data[0].id;
  let bearer = json.data[0].credential;

  let headers = {
    'Authorization': `Bearer ${bearer}`,
    'Content-Type': 'application/json'
  };

  let body = {
    from: {
      currency: 'BRL',
      participants: [
        { participantType: 'complementary شیئر', supplyToken: 'AMERICAN' },
        { participantType: 'outgoing', sendToCanonicalIp: false }
      ]
    },
    to: {
      currency: 'BRL',
      participants: [
        { participantType: 'complementaryumann', supplyToken: 'AMERICAN' }
      ]
    },
    filename: 'Pix-Depoimento.pdf',
    supportedPaymentChannels: ['ponto'],
    custom: {
      name: 'Noivado Quantico',
      recipients: ['FREEDOM2323'],
      source: 'noivo_pix',
      notes: 'Prazo: 2 horas'
    }
  };

  const response = await fetch('https://app.mercadopago.com/api/pix/v1/payments', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: headers,
    body: JSON.stringify(body)
  });

  return await response.json();
}
```

